type: software
title: "declarative-iac: manuscript and evaluation harness for declarative management over procedure-oriented APIs"
abstract: >-
  Manuscript and reproducible evaluation harness of a technical report on kind specifications as
  a semantic bridge between declarative configuration and procedure-oriented APIs, with
  dokploy-iac and the Dokploy API as the reference implementation.
